<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>Repositories · Raun</title><meta name="htmx-config" content="{&#34;allowEval&#34;:false,&#34;allowScriptTags&#34;:false,&#34;includeIndicatorStyles&#34;:false,&#34;historyCacheSize&#34;:0,&#34;selfRequestsOnly&#34;:true}"><link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/-/assets/favicon.0123abcd.svg"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/-/assets/app.0123abcd.css"><script src="/-/assets/theme.0123abcd.js"></script><script src="/-/assets/htmx.min.0123abcd.js" defer></script><script src="/-/assets/app.0123abcd.js" defer></script></head><body class="flex min-h-screen flex-col bg-ground text-foreground" hx-headers="{&#34;X-CSRF-Token&#34;:&#34;tok\&#34;en\u003c&#34;}"><a class="cn-skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a><header data-slot="topbar" class="flex min-h-16 flex-wrap items-center gap-x-5 gap-y-2 border-b border-border bg-background px-6 max-sm:px-4"><a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-2.5" aria-label="Raun home"><span class="grid size-[30px] place-items-center rounded-[7px] bg-primary text-primary-foreground"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" class="cn-icon shrink-0 size-[18px]" data-icon="rune" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5.2 2.4v11.2M5.2 2.8l5.2 2.9-5.2 2.8M5.2 8.5l6 5.1" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span> <span class="text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight">raun</span></a> <span class="h-6 w-px bg-border" aria-hidden="true"></span> <span class="font-mono text-[12.5px] text-muted-foreground">raun.acme.dev</span> <nav aria-label="Main" class="flex gap-0.5"><a class="cn-nav-link" href="/">Repositories</a><a class="cn-nav-link" href="/instance" aria-current="page">Instance settings</a></nav><span class="flex-1"></span> <span data-slot="account" class="font-mono text-[13px]">&lt;script&gt;alert(1)&lt;/script&gt;&#34; onmouseover=&#34;x</span><form method="post" action="/logout"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="tok&#34;en&lt;"><button type="submit" data-slot="button" class="cn-button inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap select-none disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 cn-button-variant-outline cn-button-size-sm">Log out</button></form><button type="button" class="cn-button inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap select-none disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 cn-button-variant-ghost cn-button-size-icon cn-theme-toggle" data-theme-toggle aria-label="Switch theme"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" class="cn-icon shrink-0 cn-when-light" data-icon="moon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M13 9.6A5.5 5.5 0 0 1 6.4 3a5.5 5.5 0 1 0 6.6 6.6z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" class="cn-icon shrink-0 cn-when-dark" data-icon="sun" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"></circle> <path d="M8 1.5v1.5M8 13v1.5M1.5 8H3M13 8h1.5M3.4 3.4l1.1 1.1M11.5 11.5l1.1 1.1M3.4 12.6l1.1-1.1M11.5 4.5l1.1-1.1" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg></button></header><main id="main" class="mx-auto flex w-full max-w-[1280px] flex-1 flex-col gap-6 px-8 pt-8 pb-12 max-sm:px-4"><h1 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Runners</h1><p class="max-w-3xl text-[13.5px] text-muted-foreground">A runner takes the jobs of its scope, the instance or one workspace, that its capabilities allow. Its token reaches the runner API only. A new token refuses the old one at once: a runner still using it stops, and the jobs it runs go back to the queue when their leases expire. A revocation refuses the runner and sends its jobs back to the queue at once.</p><section data-slot="empty" class="cn-card flex flex-col items-center gap-3.5 px-8 py-14 text-center" aria-label="No runner yet"><span class="grid size-14 place-items-center rounded-full bg-muted text-muted-foreground"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" class="cn-icon shrink-0 size-6" data-icon="folder" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M2.5 4.5a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h3l1.5 1.5h4.5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v6a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-9a1 1 0 0 1-1-1z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span><h2 class="text-[17px] font-semibold">No runner yet</h2><p class="max-w-prose text-[13.5px] text-muted-foreground">Create a runner, then start raun runner with its token.</p></section> <section data-slot="create-runner" class="cn-card flex max-w-xl flex-col gap-4 px-7 py-6"><h2 class="text-[17px] font-semibold">Create a runner</h2><form method="post" action="/instance/runners" class="flex flex-col items-start gap-4"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="tok&#34;en&lt;"><div data-slot="field" class="cn-field w-full"><label class="cn-field-label" for="name">Name</label><input id="name" name="name" type="text" data-slot="input" class="cn-input w-full min-w-0 outline-none placeholder:text-faint-foreground disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50" required autocapitalize="none" maxlength="64" spellcheck="false"></div><div data-slot="field" class="cn-field"><label class="cn-field-label" for="workspace">Scope</label> <select id="workspace" name="workspace" class="cn-input"><option value="" selected>the instance: every workspace</option> </select></div><fieldset class="flex flex-col gap-2"><legend class="cn-field-label">Capabilities</legend> <label class="flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[13.5px]"><input type="checkbox" name="capability" value="noop"> noop</label></fieldset><button type="submit" data-slot="button" class="cn-button inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap select-none disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 cn-button-variant-primary cn-button-size-md">Create the runner</button></form></section></main></body></html>